{"about_the_game":"<strong>The Ultimate Bunny Hopping Adventure!</strong> is <strong>THE</strong><br>Get ready to experience the adrenaline-pumping world of bunny hopping like never before in BhopCraze! This fast-paced, skill-based game takes the art of bunny hopping to the next level, offering over 50 official levels, multiplayer mode, a Steam Workshop, and a robust map editor for endless fun and challenges.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Let the fun begin!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1841070/6496e5c14f596e4abd69f6dc02e38018d49db8da.jpg"},{"name":"420","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1841070/d363f195e1dd93f9bf077216338107cde1c3eb80.jpg"},{"name":"Jump!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1841070/a96c8978f0845d294aed858d9b8cd0055cbcd0d9.jpg"},{"name":"Getting it!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1841070/cb52b17da8ccfdda6cb06d2e74dceea38727bbf1.jpg"},{"name":"Feeling it!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1841070/68e72743a175aec2f35473964c7271822c89f776.jpg"},{"name":"Killin' it!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1841070/f4b6ef573939489228c988bfd2b5c2068f8cca53.jpg"},{"name":"Perfection.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1841070/d8862da01cfccd38c340900ef4d4267913b0caf5.jpg"},{"name":"What do we have here!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1841070/826a55a96d755089f6377698079b76278515623c.jpg"},{"name":"Not even close!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1841070/110d0d01d88b35b0d8fb8443d1f9c75169bfb9ab.jpg"},{"name":"Easy peasy!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1841070/3db72777b9888bd1adba3c5db54aefc8c945cc57.jpg"}],"total":28},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1841070?t=1729256622","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1841070?t=1729256622","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841070/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1729256622","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841070/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1729256622","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>\ud83d\udc07 Official Levels Galore</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841070/extras/9d5add3a32a3f141c4e986f9382dfd13.poster.avif?t=1729256622\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841070/extras/9d5add3a32a3f141c4e986f9382dfd13.webm?t=1729256622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841070/extras/9d5add3a32a3f141c4e986f9382dfd13.mp4?t=1729256622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>BhopCraze boasts over 50 meticulously designed official levels, and the excitement never stops. We're constantly adding new maps to keep the challenges fresh and exciting. Each level presents a unique set of obstacles and jumps that will require precision and timing to conquer. Can you master them all?</p><br><h1>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Create Your Own Adventure or Dive into Community-Created Maps</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841070/extras/0ae61394f7b8369fe0302f3a16c2b2b3.poster.avif?t=1729256622\" width=300 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841070/extras/0ae61394f7b8369fe0302f3a16c2b2b3.webm?t=1729256622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841070/extras/0ae61394f7b8369fe0302f3a16c2b2b3.mp4?t=1729256622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841070/extras/052267294c5bd4792c76b7531939454f.poster.avif?t=1729256622\" width=300 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841070/extras/052267294c5bd4792c76b7531939454f.webm?t=1729256622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841070/extras/052267294c5bd4792c76b7531939454f.mp4?t=1729256622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Unleash your creativity with our powerful map editor, crafting your own challenging levels and sharing them with the BhopCraze community through the Steam Workshop. But that's not all \u2013 you can also explore a vast library of maps created by other users. Whether you're crafting your own intricate courses or tackling the wild creations of fellow bunny hoppers, the possibilities are endless, and the fun is limitless!</p><br><h1>\ud83c\udfae Multiplayer Madness</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841070/extras/ba7359e4c74b7fd6772635806bdff75c.poster.avif?t=1729256622\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841070/extras/ba7359e4c74b7fd6772635806bdff75c.webm?t=1729256622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841070/extras/ba7359e4c74b7fd6772635806bdff75c.mp4?t=1729256622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Challenge your friends or players from around the world in our thrilling multiplayer mode. Compete head-to-head in intense bunny hopping races, and show off your skills as you race to victory. The competition is fierce, and only the fastest bunnies will come out on top!</p><br><h1>\ud83c\udfc6 Dominate the Leaderboards and Relive Epic Hops</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841070/extras/6e3cb062889fec2961f6b27f6689ac9b.avif?t=1729256622\" width=200 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841070/extras/e563c7a8b2687bcfd6062d85573c8963.poster.avif?t=1729256622\" width=400 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841070/extras/e563c7a8b2687bcfd6062d85573c8963.webm?t=1729256622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841070/extras/e563c7a8b2687bcfd6062d85573c8963.mp4?t=1729256622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Compete for glory and bragging rights on our meticulously maintained leaderboards. With real-time rankings, you can see how you stack up against the best bunny hoppers in the world. But that's not all \u2013 you can also watch replays of the top players' most jaw-dropping bunny hopping runs. Learn from the masters, analyze their techniques, and strategize for improvement as you strive to secure your spot at the top!</p><br><h1>About the G